  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Priming Immune Function of Endangered Panama Golden Frogs Prior to Reintroduction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Priming Immune Function of Endangered Panama Golden Frogs Prior to Reintroduction in Panama. In partnership with the University of Massachusetts Boston, this project will test a new method of mucosal vaccination against chytrid in the critically endangered Panama Golden Frog. Mucosal antibody responses to the vaccine will be tested against Bd with the ultimate goal of field trial reintroductions with this successful immune priming treatment.</narrative>
  </description>
